invariant: INV-17
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: a webpki client whose server selected x25519 keeps the ML-KEM seed
  h->dz after the key exchange, so the decapsulation key it expands to
  stays recoverable from the handshake state for the rest of the
  handshake, and on the QUIC and record transports across calls. The key
  pair is unused once x25519 is selected, and docs/decisions.md entry 53
  wipes it at once.

--- old
    ct_wipe(h->dz, sizeof h->dz);
    if (!x25519(ikm, h->priv, info->server_pub)) {
--- new
    if (!x25519(ikm, h->priv, info->server_pub)) {
